From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] shcore: memory stream Clone, file stream locks, SHRegSetPath, CreateRandomAccessStreamOverStream (3653)

shcore: memory stream Clone, file stream region locks, SHRegSetPath, CreateRandomAccessStreamOverStream

Clones of SHCreateMemStream streams share the bytes. File streams implement
LockRegion/UnlockRegion. SHRegSetPath unexpands environment strings and requires the subkey.
CreateRandomAccessStreamOverStream wraps an IStream as a WinRT IRandomAccessStream (implemented
in windows.storage). shlwapi test: todo_wine removed from the memory stream Clone check.
